NetHack 3.0 is now being ported to VMS by Dave Gentzel
(gentzel@cpwscu.psc.edu) with the cooperation of Peter Trei
(ptrei@asgard.bbn.com).  If you are working on the same,
or you are interested in helping, testing, etc., please
contact either of the above directly.  We hope to have a
VMS port as part of Patch 3.

We get frequest questions about porting NetHack to the Mac.
None of us works on a Mac, so we cannot do it.  It will be
nice if those of you who have both expert knowledge of the
Mac and knowledge of NetHack get together to form a Mac-port
group to carry out this project.

-Izchak


